msgctxt "L_ELD_022"
msgid ""
"Joanna! It's Grimshaw. We've got hackers at \\nthe villa! You've got to stop"
" them\\n before they get to our files.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Joanna! C'est Grimshaw. Il y a des hackers dans \\nla villa! Arrêtez-les "
"avant\\n qu'ils ne piratent nos fichiers!\\n"

